Package: fieldbook2deltabreed
Title: Fieldbook to Deltabreed Converter
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Arlyn", "Ackerman", email = "aja294@cornell.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts Field Book '_database' exports to the DeltaBreed v1.3 import layout, including
    nested (sub-entity) experiments, and optionally fills the template columns from DeltaBreed's BrAPI.
    The conversion functions are also used by the package's Shiny app.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
